fers-resignation-in-wake-of-train-accident/a-79848097--3d039d9e0a30.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/spain-transport-minister-offers-resignation-in-wake-of-train-accident/a-79848097?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">After two deadly train crashes this year, Spanish Transport Minister Oscar Puente has said he will step down.</summary><category term="News" /></entry></feed>
